{"1421520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I Am Mouse", "steam_appid": 1421520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever been annoyed by a mouse stealing your food, chewing your things, and leaving poop behind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's <strong>I Am Mouse</strong> - and this time, you are the mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/cdf90eb681f8653c4ecee9ec38da1d63.avif?t=1783800557\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras_big/cdf90eb681f8653c4ecee9ec38da1d63.avif?t=1783800557 width=800 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of a tiny mouse in <strong>I Am Mouse</strong> - a charming, chaotic and hilarious action-adventure where you create your own path. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, sneak, or explore freely through rich environments full of choices, secrets, and alternate routes.   <br>And remember: you're not the hero. You're the problem. And that's the fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the Mouse </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're small. The world is huge.<br>Every table is a mountain. Every room is a danger zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak, climb, jump, and improvise your way through a house full of threats, traps, and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Your Instincts </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your nose is your guide. Follow the scent of food like a living radar, letting it lead you through danger and opportunity.<br>At the same time, your Mouse Vision reveals the way forward - highlighting paths, climbable objects, and hidden routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay quiet. Stay hidden… or cause a little chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steal, Carry, Survive</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab small snacks… or risk it all for something big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll massive food back to your burrow, but be careful - it's loud, risky, and the human will notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outsmart the Human</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house isn't empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The human reacts, searches, and fights back — using whatever is nearby: bats, cups, furniture… anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make one mistake, and you’re done.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever been annoyed by a mouse stealing your food, chewing your things, and leaving poop behind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's <strong>I Am Mouse</strong> - and this time, you are the mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/cdf90eb681f8653c4ecee9ec38da1d63.avif?t=1783800557\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras_big/cdf90eb681f8653c4ecee9ec38da1d63.avif?t=1783800557 width=800 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of a tiny mouse in <strong>I Am Mouse</strong> - a charming, chaotic and hilarious action-adventure where you create your own path. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, sneak, or explore freely through rich environments full of choices, secrets, and alternate routes.   <br>And remember: you're not the hero. You're the problem. And that's the fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the Mouse </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're small. The world is huge.<br>Every table is a mountain. Every room is a danger zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak, climb, jump, and improvise your way through a house full of threats, traps, and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Your Instincts </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your nose is your guide. Follow the scent of food like a living radar, letting it lead you through danger and opportunity.<br>At the same time, your Mouse Vision reveals the way forward - highlighting paths, climbable objects, and hidden routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay quiet. Stay hidden… or cause a little chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steal, Carry, Survive</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab small snacks… or risk it all for something big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll massive food back to your burrow, but be careful - it's loud, risky, and the human will notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outsmart the Human</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house isn't empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The human reacts, searches, and fights back — using whatever is nearby: bats, cups, furniture… anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make one mistake, and you’re done.</p>", "short_description": "Step into the paws of a tiny mouse in I Am Mouse, a charming third-person adventure where you create your own path. Fight, sneak, or explore freely through rich environments full of choices, secrets, and alternate routes.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian, Polish, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Spanish - Spain, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/b73b85f41b88c997226ccafde8f49998e6c6c6f9/header.jpg?t=1783800557", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/be2a2217fa536360794a8ee9b83b0bb137fcac32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783800557", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/be2a2217fa536360794a8ee9b83b0bb137fcac32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783800557", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4130 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3570 or AMD FX-8300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 570 (4gb)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Rat Studios"], "publishers": ["Rat Studios"], "demos": [{"appid": 3684870, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap